 desk-agent  /work/demo on main                                       test-model
 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   /clear             Clear the screen; the conversation is kept
   /context           Show how much of the context window is used
   /effort [LEVEL]    Show the reasoning effort, or set it
   /exit              Quit
   /help              List the commands and keys
   /model [NAME]      Show the model, or switch to NAME
   /quit              Quit
   /reconnect [NAME]  Start MCP servers again: the named one, or those that
                      failed
   /reset             Forget the conversation and start over
   /retry             Send the last prompt again
   /servers           List the MCP servers and how they are doing
   /tools             List the tools and which of them ask before they run
   /undo              Remove the last exchange from the conversation

   enter        send
   shift+enter  new line
   pgup/pgdn    scroll
   ↑/↓          scroll a line (empty input)
   ctrl+c       cancel a turn, clear the input, quit
   ctrl+d       quit on an empty input
   mouse wheel  scroll the transcript (hold Shift to select text)











 ╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │ ❯ Ask anything, or /help for commands...                                    │
